[{"answer":"Right. Are we all here?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Okay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/2.mp3"},{"answer":"As you know, today Vivien is going to do a presentation on the hat-making project","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/3.mp3"},{"answer":"she did with her class during her last teaching practice. So...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Over to you, Vivien.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Thanks.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/6.mp3"},{"answer":"Mr Yardley has asked me to describe to you","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/7.mp3"},{"answer":"the project I did as a student teacher at a secondary school in London.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I was at this school for six weeks","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/9.mp3"},{"answer":"and I taught a variety of subjects to a class of 14 year old pupils.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/10.mp3"},{"answer":"The project I chose to do was a hat-making project","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/11.mp3"},{"answer":"and I think this project could easily be adapted to suit any age.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/12.mp3"},{"answer":"So, to explain the project...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/13.mp3"},{"answer":"After we'd done the research,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/14.mp3"},{"answer":"we went back to the classroom to make two basic hat shapes using rolls of old wallpaper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/15.mp3"},{"answer":"We each made, first of all, a conical hat by...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/16.mp3"},{"answer":"well, if I show you now...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/17.mp3"},{"answer":"cutting out a circle and then making one cut up to the centre","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/18.mp3"},{"answer":"and then... er... overlapping the cut like this...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/19.mp3"},{"answer":"a conical hat that sits on your head.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/20.mp3"},{"answer":"The other hat we made was a little more complicated.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/21.mp3"},{"answer":"First of all, we cut out a circle again...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/22.mp3"},{"answer":"like this...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/23.mp3"},{"answer":"then you need a long piece with flaps on it.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/24.mp3"},{"answer":"I've already made that bit which I have here.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/25.mp3"},{"answer":"you bend the flaps over and stick them with glue or prittstick","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/26.mp3"},{"answer":"to the underside of the circle... like this.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/27.mp3"},{"answer":"Again, I've prepared this so that I don't get glue everywhere.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/28.mp3"},{"answer":"The pupils do, of course, so you need plenty of covers for the table.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/29.mp3"},{"answer":"And there you have a pillbox hat as in pill and box.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/30.mp3"},{"answer":"Now variations and combinations of these two hat shapes formed the basis of the pupils' final designs.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/31.mp3"},{"answer":"The next stage of the project was the design phase","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/32.mp3"},{"answer":"and this involved, first of all, using their pages of research to draw a design of their hat on paper.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/33.mp3"},{"answer":"That's the easy part.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/34.mp3"},{"answer":"They then had to translate their two-dimensional design into a form to fit their head.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/35.mp3"},{"answer":"I encouraged them to make a small-scale, three dimensional hat first","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/36.mp3"},{"answer":"so that they could experiment with how to achieve the form they required","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/37.mp3"},{"answer":"and I imposed certain constraints on them to keep things simple.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/38.mp3"},{"answer":"For example, they had to use paper not card.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Paper is more pliable and easier to handle.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/40.mp3"},{"answer":"They also had to limit their colours to white, grey or brown shades of paper","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/41.mp3"},{"answer":"which reflected the colours of the buildings they were using as a model for their hats","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/42.mp3"},{"answer":"and they had to make sure their glue didn't show!","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/43.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, it was very enjoyable","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/44.mp3"},{"answer":"and just to give you an idea of what they produced,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/45.mp3"},{"answer":"I've brought along three hats to show you.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/46.mp3"},{"answer":"This one here is based on a circular stairway in an old building in London.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/47.mp3"},{"answer":"It uses three pillbox hats, one on top of the other.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/48.mp3"},{"answer":"This was designed by Theresa.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Here's another one that has a simple strip going round the base of the hat","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/50.mp3"},{"answer":"but has then gone on to add strips of paper that come out from the base","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/51.mp3"},{"answer":"and that meet at the top of the hat - rather like a crown -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/52.mp3"},{"answer":"making a fairly tall hat.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/53.mp3"},{"answer":"This was made by Muriel.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/54.mp3"},{"answer":"And lastly, there's a combination of the pillbox or single strip around the base","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/55.mp3"},{"answer":"and then the conical hat shape on top to form a castle turret.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/56.mp3"},{"answer":"This was made by Fabrice,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/57.mp3"},{"answer":"and there are many more that I could have brought.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/58.mp3"},{"answer":"Thank you, Vivien.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/59.mp3"},{"answer":"That was most interesting.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/60.mp3"},{"answer":"Now what we can learn from this...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-4-2023-08-15-21-30-32/61.mp3"}]
